## 4. MOAT MECHANISMS (Deep Analysis)

### 4.1 Data Moat: Historical Usage Intelligence

**What accumulates:**
- 3-6 months minimum for meaningful forecasting [K, AWS/FinOps Foundation]
- AWS extended historical analysis from 6 → 36 months [K, AWS re:Invent 2025]
- Custom allocation rules, team attribution, tagging strategies
- Model performance benchmarks per use-case per department
